    <briefdescription>
<para>Immutable receipt for a single distribution event. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each time an artifact (<ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_lo_r_a_package" kindref="compound">LoRAPackage</ref> or <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_adapter_product" kindref="compound">AdapterProduct</ref>) is distributed, exported, or placed on a shard, a <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_distribution_receipt" kindref="compound">DistributionReceipt</ref> is generated. Receipts are linked in a tamper-evident chain via parent_receipt_hash.</para>
<para>Supported event types: &quot;deploy&quot;, &quot;export&quot;, &quot;shard_distribute&quot;, &quot;federated_sync&quot;, &quot;checkpoint_transfer&quot;.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>receipt_hash covers all content fields and links (excluding receipt_hash itself). </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
